        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Plaque Psoriasis The safety and effectiveness of TREMFYA for the treatment of moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis have been established in pediatric patients 6 years of age and older who are candidates for systemic therapy or phototherapy [see Adverse Reactions (6.1) and Clinical Studies (14.1) ] .",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-tremfya",
          "section": "8.4"
