        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Of the 6418 subjects with plaque psoriasis, psoriatic arthritis, ulcerative colitis, or Crohn's disease exposed to TREMFYA, a total of 489 subjects were 65 years or older, and 55 subjects were 75 years or older.",
